                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Spent all morning on the House floor with @RepJeffries as Republicans tried to jam through their despicable bill.\n\nHe laid out exactly what\u2019s at stake: cuts to health care, cuts to food assistance, & so many Americans who will be hurt just to give billionaires another tax break.",
