                "text": "On Medicaid's 60th anniversary, I gathered health care workers, hospital leaders, and patients at Wyckoff in Bushwick to speak out against the GOP\u2019s massive health care cuts.\n\u00a0\nThis is the biggest attack on care in our nation\u2019s history and we won't stop fighting. https://t.co/Vo0Srw1fzm",
