                "text": "Across our communities, families are worried about rising costs and losing coverage as Republicans push devastating cuts to Medicaid and the ACA.\n\nToday, we came together to hear directly from patients, providers, and experts\u2014to make one thing clear: health care is a right, not a privilege. \n\nWe will keep fighting to protect affordable care for every New Yorker.\n\nThank you to Wyckoff Medical Center and Assemblywoman D\u00e1vila for making today\u2019s roundtable possible.",
